R7mPEgQ3IcHCEcoDA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_TWO"],"2 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjm2Z6L6tGWAxXFi68BHR7mPEgQ3YcHCEooAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwjm2Z6L6tGWAxXFi68BHR7mPEgQ3IcHCEkoDQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這天中午，我們前往北投進行假日小旅行，找了一下新北投附近的素食店，似乎不是沒營業，不然就是沒有我們都喜歡的拉麵麵食選項，突然看到地圖有一個素食壽司拉麵，離捷運站不遠，剛好是我們路途會經過的點。\n\n提前於石牌站下車，步行約8~10分鐘，邊散步邊聊著我們意猶未竟的話題，沿著捷運高架下的公園，很快就到素食壽司拉麵店。\n\n店面不大，約可容納二個客人，剛好還沒人，我們趕緊把東西放下，選我們想要的麵。\n\n我們選了福井白醬拉麵、味噌蔬菜拉麵，蔬菜很多，跟麵條的比率約2:3，所以一口麵搭配一小撮菜，口感很爽口。\n\n最後吃完我們還覺得沒吃飽，又再多點了咖哩拉麵，可惜忘了問老闆娘咖哩是乾的還是湯，因為我們都喜歡喝湯，雖然少了點湯頭，整個吃完仍滿滿的飽足感，我們就一路繼續走到其哩岸捷運站。",null,[0,96]]]],[],[null,null,1389,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xBNVNYYzFTVkJ1YVc1UGVURlpWRU0yZEd4RmMwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xbef2c9bc09008feb!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlA5SXc1SVBuaW5PeTFZVEM2dGxFc0E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xBNVNYYzFTVkJ1YVc1UGVURlpWRU0yZEd4RmMwRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xBNVNYYzFTVkJ1YVc1UGVURlpWRU0yZEd4RmMwRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xBNVNYYzFTVkJ1YVc1UGVURlpWRU0yZEd4RmMwRRILMGU4d1pxMnlaTG4aPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sQTVTWGMxU1ZCdWFXNVBlVEZaVkVNMmRHeEZjMEUSCzBlOHdacTJ5WkxuIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR648ACbzJ8r4qCzBlOHdacTJ5Wkxu\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjm2Z6L6tGWAxXFi68BHR7mPEgQoykISygO"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwic0aOL6tGWAxWVjMAFHcqKLE0Q0pMFCAIoAA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjm2Z6L6tGWAxXFi68BHR7mPEgQ0pMFCDIoAA"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KR1RXWlpRVlp5YkU1MVVVWTNjMDk0TFhaUWVGRRAB",["0x0:0xbef2c9bc09008feb",null,1763286942315171,1763287448370054,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104732491736986196490/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Chang Fang-Rung","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXa_uD_ycGCScwosPJQsYNIjhaqqx8sHbRc7lEFTZVfwnUHkd