，是真正用好米、好食材在照顧客人的身體。\n\n她的料理自信不是炫耀，而是來自長年累積的經驗與對全素飲食的深刻理解。全店所有料理皆為全素，無負擔、無壓力，讓全素者吃得安心，也讓一般客人吃得驚喜。雖然空間迷你，但每道料理都像是被精心雕琢過——味道乾淨、層次豐富、用料不手軟，一看就知道老闆娘是把最好的都端上桌。\n\n走出店門後，留下的不是單純的飽足，而是一種被真心對待、被好食材療癒的感覺。這家店小歸小，但料理的靈魂絕對巨大，是那種會讓人想再訪、也願意帶朋友來體會的溫暖小店。",null,[0,131]]]],[],[null,null,5204,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KR1RXWlpRVlp5YkU1MVVVWTNjMDk0TFhaUWVGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xbef2c9bc09008feb!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmJGTWZZQVZybE51UUY3c094LXZQeFE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KR1RXWlpRVlp5YkU1MVVVWTNjMDk0TFhaUWVGRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KR1RXWlpRVlp5YkU1MVVVWTNjMDk0TFhaUWVGRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KR1RXWlpRVlp5YkU1MVVVWTNjMDk0TFhaUWVGRRILMGQ1UDVOTDJkUUkaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tSkdUV1paUVZaeWJFNTFVVVkzYzA5NExYWlFlRkUSCzBkNVA1TkwyZFFJIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR648ACbzJ8r4qCzBkNVA1TkwyZFFJ\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjm2Z6L6tGWAxXFi68BHR7mPEgQoykIZSgO"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwic0aOL6tGWAxWVjMAFHcqKLE0Q0pMFCBwoAQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjm2Z6L6tGWAxXFi68BHR7mPEgQ0pMFCEwoAQ"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sSmJXazNjbU5uVVdac1VIbEJTVXA2YUhKUVdsRRAB",["0x0:0xbef2c9bc09008feb",null,1779210701872991,1779210701872991,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100037639656705955974/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Avery Liu","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI50xhTBxmNIfMSaff0SS7ttTwbGnJVqUdRMbI9lbx4S09h-rk\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100037639656705955974?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"100037639656705955974",null,175,363,null,[1,6,1],17,["在地嚮導 · 175 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwjm2Z6L6tGWAxXFi68BHR7mPEgQpr8GCGcoAA"]]]],null,"3 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[4],null,[["CIABIhDvaFao1xYbtCovuwVGx6FH",["CIABIhDvaFao1xYbtCov