,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["在這裡用餐是一種很的特殊的體驗，會讓你感覺是在日本用餐，而且是為了你倆而開的店（包場）。因為座位只有兩個。\n以台北物價來說，這家店的性價比非常高，因為老闆娘很堅持用好的食材來料理。尤其那個飯糰與咖哩飯都是用同一種米來料理，但都相當的好吃。老闆娘說米是用比較好的米。老闆娘對於自己的東西相當有自信。這點我想當肯定。\n\n今日吃了兩碗拉麵，一碗咖哩飯，一個飯糰，以及外帶一盒豆皮壽司（最後一盒）。總共消費才500元。兩個人去吃的超飽！\n\n很推薦有來石牌站的朋友，可以來這裡吃看看美味的全素料理。這裡的蛋是要額外加錢的，料理都是全素為主。來這裡用餐的體驗真的很特殊。大推！！！",null,[0,156]]]],[],[null,null,3958,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paM01scERlSEpSYTFOR1ZIZEtlVWRpTFhKMlZGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xbef2c9bc09008feb!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjZ3MlpDeHJRa1NGVHdKeUdiLXJ2VFE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paM01scERlSEpSYTFOR1ZIZEtlVWRpTFhKMlZGRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paM01scERlSEpSYTFOR1ZIZEtlVWRpTFhKMlZGRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paM01scERlSEpSYTFOR1ZIZEtlVWRpTFhKMlZGRRILMGQ0VEtJUkhaUlQaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09qWjNNbHBEZUhKUmExTkdWSGRLZVVkaUxYSjJWRkUSCzBkNFRLSVJIWlJUIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR648ACbzJ8r4qCzBkNFRLSVJIWlJU\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjm2Z6L6tGWAxXFi68BHR7mPEgQoykIhAEoCA"],null,[null,[[1,1]]]],"0ahUKEwic0aOL6tGWAxWVjMAFHcqKLE0Q0pMFCEQoAw"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjm2Z6L6tGWAxXFi68BHR7mPEgQ0pMFCHQoAw"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkT2VYRkVWalpHVm1sbmIyVTRkbWxJZG5KbE4wRRAB",["0x0:0xbef2c9bc09008feb",null,1779164456792337,1779164456792337,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116377281233129783543/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Riley Wang","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXNCUzKfhetOgOia_Zot3pKxQiEL8G2XWwFWzsbn3wI3anKnvmajw\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116377281233129783543?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"116377281233129783543",null,65,105,null,[1,6,1],9,["在地嚮導 · 65 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwjm2Z6L6tGWAxXFi68BHR7mPEgQpr8GCIYBKAA"]]]],null,"3 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/br